  "interpretation_notes": [
    "The complete original January parameter responses for both Pickens permits contain ammonia and no total nitrogen, nitrate or TKN record. Their original total-N00600 response covers February through December (11 months); retain the resulting measured period explicitly.",
    "Milliken's original 2023 inventory reports nitrate00620, not total nitrogen00600. It has both populated and NODI C parallel limit branches; retain all records and select eligible statistics by original statistical base/type and units.",
    "Parameter rows retain all original permit-version, internal feature, limit, schedule, event, form-value and DMR-value IDs. Internal IDs change across the year; do not select max VersionNmbr globally.",
    "Reported daily-mass-rate and concentration statistics have separate meanings. Monthly/weekly/maximum rows must not be summed together. Use the reported standard-unit values with their original units.",
    "No duration-of-discharge parameter appears in the four complete annual inventories. Any period integration should state its continuous-period assumption and retain the monitoring period and NmbrOfSubmission.",
    "The original 2023 lake campaign is seasonal ambient concentration and response context. Point-source DMR loads are a separate source input for comparison with native NDR land-cover export."
  ],
